WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.906
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:05.176 --> 00:06.576
[Previously] Why are you doing this?

3
00:07.000 --> 00:09.401
What you and Tokyo are doing really isn't safe.

4
00:09.496 --> 00:12.160
Tokyo could end up in danger too.

5
00:12.488 --> 00:16.341
We can handle our own relationships. We don't need you interfering.

6
00:17.766 --> 00:20.840
We're not going to break up because of anyone else.

7
00:21.078 --> 00:22.479
If we ever do break up,

8
00:22.720 --> 00:24.880
it should be because we don't love each other anymore.

9
00:52.720 --> 00:55.387
You can go now. The party is over.

10
00:55.552 --> 00:57.152
And people will start to come back here.

11
00:58.053 --> 00:59.054
Okay.

12
01:01.238 --> 01:02.450
I'm sweaty.

13
01:05.616 --> 01:06.617
Come on.

14
01:08.958 --> 01:09.959
You should go.

15
01:12.019 --> 01:13.620
Wait…just a minute.

16
01:18.987 --> 01:20.200
What are you doing?

17
01:22.544 --> 01:23.880
Tokyo!

18
01:24.652 --> 01:26.320
The teachers planted these roses.

19
01:29.611 --> 01:31.920
It's okay, just one rose.

20
01:34.059 --> 01:35.460
What are you doing?

21
01:36.387 --> 01:37.600
Gosh, you're bleeding.

22
01:38.326 --> 01:39.427
It's okay.

23
01:42.912 --> 01:43.913
Here, this is for you.

24
01:52.246 --> 01:53.247
Are you hitting on me?

25
01:55.640 --> 01:56.641
Not really.

26
02:01.041 --> 02:02.242
I won you over ages ago.

27
02:10.739 --> 02:11.920
You can go now.

28
02:12.078 --> 02:13.720
Yeah, I know.

29
02:14.200 --> 02:15.320
I'm really leaving now.

30
02:16.686 --> 02:17.687
Bye.

31
02:36.464 --> 02:37.465
Tokyo.

32
02:41.275 --> 02:42.276
Can I talk to you?

33
02:53.400 --> 02:57.400
"Juliet &amp; Juliet" (Episode 5)

34
03:04.942 --> 03:07.680
Well? Are you ready to tell me?

35
03:10.446 --> 03:11.840
I told you, it's nothing.

36
03:13.166 --> 03:14.450
Why can't you just believe me?

37
03:14.750 --> 03:16.070
How am I supposed to believe you?

38
03:22.158 --> 03:24.100
How could you do this?

39
03:27.679 --> 03:30.400
You're lying to Dad and to me.

40
03:30.710 --> 03:31.800
You're lying to Big.

41
03:31.926 --> 03:33.526
You're lying to everyone in this family.

42
03:34.902 --> 03:36.440
You're betraying the Kongpurim family.

43
03:38.262 --> 03:39.462
It's because of her, isn't it?

44
03:39.923 --> 03:42.843
Is that why you want to study in England? What the hell are you thinking?

45
03:50.050 --> 03:52.080
This has nothing to do with Blue, Yi.

46
03:55.971 --> 03:57.672
I just don't want to stay here.

47
04:00.131 --> 04:02.132
Because you and Dad are always like this.

48
04:06.926 --> 04:09.640
The girl from that family has completely brainwashed you, Tokyo.

49
04:12.900 --> 04:14.500
Don't you ever stop and think, Yi?

50
04:15.931 --> 04:18.000
All you do is obsess over which side everyone is on

51
04:18.422 --> 04:19.700
and who's going to strike first.

52
04:19.723 --> 04:20.724
Tokyo!

53
04:34.792 --> 04:37.312
Do you really want to live like this for the rest of your life?

54
04:42.955 --> 04:45.600
If you want to stay here, then stay.

55
04:50.700 --> 04:52.440
But my dreams aren't here.

56
04:56.001 --> 04:57.920
I want to go out and see the world.

57
04:58.267 --> 05:00.100
I don't want to stay here.

58
05:00.358 --> 05:01.359
No.

59
05:02.624 --> 05:03.680
No means no.

60
05:05.040 --> 05:06.920
No matter what, you're better off staying home.

61
05:09.682 --> 05:10.986
How would that be better for me?

62
05:13.123 --> 05:15.243
Have you ever tried leaving and doing something else?

63
05:16.220 --> 05:18.770
Have you ever tried stepping out from under Dad's shadow?

64
05:21.000 --> 05:22.520
You've never even tried.

65
05:22.856 --> 05:24.960
So how would you know which life is better?

66
05:27.091 --> 05:29.920
Won't you let me try living my own life for once?

67
05:31.726 --> 05:33.600
Stop making excuses.

68
05:34.264 --> 05:35.565
Do you think I don't know

69
05:35.784 --> 05:37.920
you only want to follow that girl from that family?

70
05:44.200 --> 05:46.201
Tokyo, if you don't stop,

71
05:47.287 --> 05:48.406
I'll show you

72
05:48.784 --> 05:50.885
what the eldest son of the Kongpurim family

73
05:51.400 --> 05:52.680
is capable of putting an end to.

74
06:05.033 --> 06:06.353
Come on. Put some effort into it.

75
06:10.744 --> 06:12.200
You're so useless.

76
06:12.680 --> 06:14.632
Who the hell would be afraid of you?

77
06:24.470 --> 06:25.491
Has Big told you yet

78
06:26.400 --> 06:28.320
when we can reopen our casino?

79
06:29.790 --> 06:30.791
Not yet, Dad.

80
06:31.710 --> 06:33.590
But if we keep running short of cash like this,

81
06:33.966 --> 06:35.467
all our men will desert us.

82
06:37.550 --> 06:40.091
Especially if we have to go up against the Monchaitrakul family right now.

83
06:40.115 --> 06:41.320
I'm not even sure

84
06:42.552 --> 06:43.553
we can handle them.

85
06:44.691 --> 06:46.400
Commander Sin just warned us

86
06:47.648 --> 06:49.040
about going after them.

87
06:50.032 --> 06:53.160
That's why I don't want to risk a direct confrontation right now.

88
07:00.220 --> 07:03.021
So, what's going on between Tokyo and that girl?

89
07:06.574 --> 07:07.575
Well...

90
07:11.358 --> 07:14.100
Nothing has happened yet, Dad.

91
07:17.240 --> 07:18.400
Don't let me find out later

92
07:19.475 --> 07:20.476
that you chickened out.

93
07:24.400 --> 07:25.401
Yes, sir.

94
08:03.331 --> 08:04.840
Did you tell Pakkad?

95
08:13.112 --> 08:14.113
And…

96
08:16.930 --> 08:18.451
Who do you think sent the photo?

97
08:22.334 --> 08:23.335
I don't know.

98
08:25.731 --> 08:26.732
It could be...

99
08:27.694 --> 08:29.520
anyone.

100
08:30.872 --> 08:32.300
Anyone at this school.

101
08:34.232 --> 08:36.120
Then we can't trust anyone at all.

102
08:38.637 --> 08:39.638
Yeah.

103
08:44.454 --> 08:45.455
What are you doing?

104
08:46.854 --> 08:48.214
Applying through direct admission.

105
08:49.590 --> 08:51.670
I'm thinking of going to the same university as you.

106
08:52.720 --> 08:53.721
What?

107
08:53.821 --> 08:54.822
Yeah.

108
08:54.900 --> 08:57.140
Let's go to Bangkok and take the entrance exam together.

109
08:57.198 --> 08:58.370
Then we can study together.

110
08:59.080 --> 09:00.781
Which faculty are you applying to?

111
09:03.843 --> 09:04.844
Um...

112
09:06.220 --> 09:07.260
Maybe the Faculty of Arts.

113
09:09.699 --> 09:11.600
Honestly, I'm still not entirely sure.

114
09:12.696 --> 09:13.697
But

115
09:15.414 --> 09:17.240
if I don't do something now,

116
09:19.120 --> 09:21.040
I'll be stuck here for the rest of my life.

117
09:29.873 --> 09:32.280
[University application to the faculty of law, with a middling chance of getting in]

118
09:33.339 --> 09:35.039
[English linguistics, a good chance of getting in]

119
09:36.904 --> 09:38.344
Then let's apply to this university.

120
09:39.498 --> 09:41.766
Last year's cutoff score wasn't very high.

121
09:41.790 --> 09:43.470
We might both have a chance of getting in.

122
09:44.867 --> 09:45.868
No.

123
09:46.446 --> 09:48.480
That's not the university you want to attend.

124
09:49.363 --> 09:50.520
It's okay.

125
09:52.302 --> 09:53.303
No, it's not.

126
09:53.939 --> 09:56.416
Look. The exam's on the same day as the one for Srisilapasat University

127
09:56.440 --> 09:57.480
that you want to get into.

128
09:58.912 --> 10:00.520
It's fine. Let's go with this one.

129
10:02.075 --> 10:03.076
Okay?

130
10:03.136 --> 10:06.000
Then in two weeks, we'll go to Bangkok and take the exam together.

131
10:21.800 --> 10:23.827
All right, class.

132
10:24.782 --> 10:26.650
Open your books to page 75.

133
10:27.230 --> 10:30.600
We're still studying European history.

134
11:02.800 --> 11:04.301
This wasn't you, was it?

135
11:06.296 --> 11:07.400
Of course not.

136
11:07.497 --> 11:10.337
What kind of person do you think I am? I'm your cousin, for God's sake.

137
11:11.280 --> 11:12.560
Damn it.

138
11:13.240 --> 11:18.360
How the hell did this go from a cute romance to a freaking thriller?

139
11:18.840 --> 11:20.080
Then who do you think did it?

140
11:21.160 --> 11:23.920
I don't know. That's why I'm freaking out.

141
11:29.450 --> 11:30.451
Unless...

142
11:31.840 --> 11:33.441
it was Tokyo's friends.

143
11:35.187 --> 11:36.688
It's possible.

144
11:37.920 --> 11:39.560
Remember when you first transferred here?

145
11:39.720 --> 11:41.321
Remember what I told you?

146
11:41.880 --> 11:45.257
That Pupae and Jai only became friends with Tokyo because they were scared of her dad.

147
11:45.281 --> 11:46.482
I'm serious. It's true.

148
12:04.032 --> 12:05.600
- What? - Hey!

149
12:06.840 --> 12:08.520
- What the hell? - Get someone to help. Hurry!

150
12:08.541 --> 12:10.242
- Let's go! - Okay.

151
12:17.280 --> 12:19.681
[Everything's going according to plan.]

152
12:40.227 --> 12:41.960
Sorry to bother you, Wiboon.

153
12:42.179 --> 12:44.000
About the accident at the pier,

154
12:44.275 --> 12:47.130
I'm afraid we'll have to suspend all construction work by your company

155
12:47.902 --> 12:50.960
until we've investigated the accident and established what happened.

156
12:53.528 --> 12:54.529
I understand.

157
12:55.299 --> 12:57.500
And I'm willing to fully cooperate.

158
13:07.995 --> 13:11.579
I just hope everything gets resolved in time

159
13:12.536 --> 13:14.336
for me to hand over the project as scheduled.

160
13:16.054 --> 13:17.080
I'd like to help,

161
13:17.675 --> 13:20.475
but this time, you'll have to follow the proper procedure, Mr. Wiboon.

162
13:22.560 --> 13:23.561
Excuse me.

163
13:33.811 --> 13:36.120
Miss Tokyo, I'll pick you up after school.

164
14:01.203 --> 14:02.204
Hey,

165
14:03.347 --> 14:04.348
what is going on?

166
14:06.414 --> 14:09.160
It was May's dad. The scaffolding collapsed on him.

167
14:09.336 --> 14:11.137
So people are pissed.

168
14:11.237 --> 14:14.200
They think the Monchaitrakul family took over and started cutting corners.

169
14:14.302 --> 14:16.702
Things weren't like this when the Kongpurims were in charge.

170
14:27.102 --> 14:29.403
Hey, aren't you gonna turn in your phone?

171
14:29.528 --> 14:31.429
You just got it. Paew's gonna confiscate it.

172
15:14.300 --> 15:15.301
Aren't you coming?

173
15:20.104 --> 15:21.360
What are you gonna do?

174
15:28.576 --> 15:29.577
I'm sure...

175
15:31.771 --> 15:33.040
Pae and Jai

176
15:33.686 --> 15:35.640
weren't the ones who sold our photo to Yi.

177
15:37.880 --> 15:38.881
But...

178
15:40.256 --> 15:41.496
something's still bothering me.

179
16:04.320 --> 16:05.960
That photo Yi got

180
16:06.726 --> 16:08.486
was so blurry you could barely see anything.

181
16:10.459 --> 16:12.019
There's no way it came from this phone.

182
16:12.554 --> 16:13.560
So we can stop worrying.

183
16:14.955 --> 16:15.956
Yeah, I guess.

184
16:16.704 --> 16:19.130
But how did Pae suddenly get a new phone?

185
16:20.507 --> 16:22.720
Her family's already up to their necks in debt.

186
16:31.299 --> 16:32.960
Why don't you just ask her?

187
16:34.264 --> 16:35.961
I asked Pakkad straight up.

188
16:40.475 --> 16:44.000
Hey! Why are you going through our lockers?

189
16:51.179 --> 16:52.760
I just needed to borrow a pad.

190
16:53.880 --> 16:54.881
I forgot to bring one.

191
17:04.672 --> 17:05.673
Go ahead.

192
17:09.235 --> 17:10.236
Thanks.

193
17:30.100 --> 17:32.451
Dad, are you really going through with opening another casino?

194
17:32.475 --> 17:33.800
You thought I was kidding?

195
17:34.550 --> 17:35.801
I'm on my way to Korat

196
17:36.699 --> 17:38.140
to raise some money for it.

197
17:39.483 --> 17:41.443
But I am about to become a police inspector, Dad.

198
17:41.600 --> 17:42.840
Can't you wait a little longer?

199
17:44.697 --> 17:46.998
If I wait for you, we'll be broke by then.

200
17:47.446 --> 17:49.840
Didn't I tell you to wrap up that case at the pier?

201
17:50.304 --> 17:52.550
The Monchaitrakuls finally screwed up.

202
17:53.339 --> 17:54.840
I wanna bury them for good.

203
17:56.224 --> 17:57.225
I know, Dad.

204
17:57.632 --> 17:58.880
Just give me some time.

205
18:00.053 --> 18:03.120
Finding enough evidence to get their concession revoked isn't that easy.

206
18:05.920 --> 18:07.200
A fish that never bites

207
18:07.921 --> 18:09.440
may look harmless.

208
18:10.356 --> 18:11.600
But in my eyes,

209
18:12.955 --> 18:14.880
it's nothing but weak prey.

210
18:28.955 --> 18:29.956
Dad?

211
18:51.126 --> 18:52.512
Evening, Boss.

212
18:52.700 --> 18:53.701
Hey.

213
18:57.000 --> 18:59.730
So, how's your daughter liking her new phone?

214
19:01.467 --> 19:04.168
She loves it. Can't put the thing down.

215
19:06.627 --> 19:08.200
Thanks again, Boss.

216
19:08.622 --> 19:10.880
Pupae had been using that old phone forever.

217
19:12.350 --> 19:15.000
I just couldn't afford to get her a new one.

218
19:15.907 --> 19:16.908
Don't mention it.

219
19:17.272 --> 19:18.700
I've known her since she was a kid.

220
19:18.931 --> 19:20.880
She's practically family.

221
19:22.896 --> 19:24.627
About that thing you asked me to take care of...

222
19:24.651 --> 19:25.720
It's done.

223
19:26.678 --> 19:30.200
I've got almost all the local transport operators on board.

224
19:30.800 --> 19:31.801
Good.

225
19:32.494 --> 19:35.250
The pier closes tomorrow for the accident investigation.

226
19:35.518 --> 19:37.880
That'll make things tough for the local vendors.

227
19:38.100 --> 19:40.158
The locals need to remember

228
19:40.211 --> 19:42.560
who they turn to when times get tough.

229
19:45.440 --> 19:46.600
If there's nothing else,

230
19:46.984 --> 19:48.320
I'll be going, Boss.

231
19:48.480 --> 19:49.520
- Oh, bye. - Bye, sir.

232
19:49.581 --> 19:50.920
- Thank you. - You're welcome.

233
19:54.840 --> 19:56.960
If there's anything you need, just let me know.

234
19:57.560 --> 19:59.170
I'll take care of everything.

235
19:59.558 --> 20:01.160
There's only one thing I want.

236
20:01.440 --> 20:03.620
I need the pier reopened as soon as possible.

237
20:04.784 --> 20:06.550
If you don't mind me saying Wiboon,

238
20:07.067 --> 20:09.267
I think you should stop trying to pull strings for now.

239
20:09.440 --> 20:11.120
You've already stepped down. Just lay low.

240
20:11.408 --> 20:13.680
No one wants to get dragged into this mess.

241
20:18.054 --> 20:19.455
The workers are awake, Boss.

242
20:20.055 --> 20:22.215
They confirmed they set up the scaffolding themselves.

243
20:22.422 --> 20:24.342
There's no way it could've collapsed on its own.

244
20:24.606 --> 20:25.960
But as they were leaving,

245
20:26.310 --> 20:28.320
they saw two new workers come in.

246
20:29.184 --> 20:31.360
We're looking into who they were.

247
20:33.344 --> 20:35.345
Make sure we cover all their expenses.

248
20:35.799 --> 20:37.800
And keep them safe as our witnesses.

249
20:38.000 --> 20:39.001
Yes, Boss.

250
21:08.280 --> 21:11.040
I asked her to help Phu with the insurance paperwork.

251
21:11.281 --> 21:13.200
She gets a little extra for helping out.

252
21:14.500 --> 21:15.960
Go with Phu to the other room.

253
21:26.501 --> 21:27.502
Want some water?

254
21:47.432 --> 21:50.445
We made the right call moving here, didn't we?

255
21:52.000 --> 21:56.320
We could always move back to build housing developments.

256
21:58.800 --> 21:59.801
No.

257
22:01.256 --> 22:03.200
This is where we belong.

258
22:05.048 --> 22:06.200
We were here before them.

259
22:19.486 --> 22:21.566
So you're really gonna take the entrance exam there?

260
22:22.278 --> 22:23.438
You sure you won't regret it?

261
22:27.051 --> 22:28.152
Of course I will.

262
22:29.318 --> 22:30.480
But what else can I do?

263
22:35.262 --> 22:36.263
I don't know.

264
22:37.598 --> 22:39.680
I don't even know where things are going with us.

265
22:40.890 --> 22:42.090
It's such a freaking headache.

266
22:42.571 --> 22:43.760
Whoa, you've got it bad.

267
22:44.230 --> 22:46.200
You're really giving up your dream for one girl?

268
22:48.427 --> 22:50.680
What if you and Tokyo break up before then?

269
22:52.352 --> 22:54.450
What if one of you gives up first?

270
23:32.374 --> 23:34.814
In two weeks, we'll go to Bangkok and take the exam together.

271
23:35.240 --> 23:36.641
Why the long face?

272
23:37.834 --> 23:40.113
Because you're giving up your dream for me.

273
23:45.720 --> 23:46.880
Don't overthink it.

274
23:48.462 --> 23:50.856
You're giving up your family,

275
23:50.920 --> 23:52.440
your home, everything here.

276
23:54.856 --> 23:56.560
So we're meeting each other halfway.

277
23:57.928 --> 24:00.120
I give up a little, you give up a little,

278
24:05.907 --> 24:07.250
so we can be together.

279
24:11.300 --> 24:12.301
You mean it?

280
24:26.960 --> 24:30.640
[Bangkok Entrance Exam Meet at the bus station, 5:00 AM]

281
25:34.579 --> 25:36.100
Bangkok! Hop on!

282
25:36.515 --> 25:39.680
Bangkok! Get on! We're leaving as soon as we're full!

283
25:39.704 --> 25:41.664
[Blue: Where are you? The bus is about to leave.]

284
25:54.294 --> 25:55.574
Where do you think you're going?

285
25:57.640 --> 25:58.641
To take an exam.

286
25:58.960 --> 25:59.961
Where?

287
26:01.264 --> 26:02.265
Bangkok.

288
26:03.302 --> 26:04.662
You're going with her, aren't you?

289
26:06.635 --> 26:07.636
Come here.

290
26:08.560 --> 26:10.400
No! Let go of me.

291
26:11.686 --> 26:12.720
You're so mean!

292
26:13.959 --> 26:15.519
Why do you have to be so damn stubborn?

293
26:16.332 --> 26:18.932
You love her so much you're willing to leave your family for her?

294
26:19.800 --> 26:20.801
I love her.

295
26:22.700 --> 26:24.720
But I love Dad and you guys too.

296
26:25.552 --> 26:27.553
If you love us, then choose us.

297
26:27.600 --> 26:28.960
Why would you choose her?

298
26:36.944 --> 26:39.320
I've chosen you and Dad my whole life.

299
26:40.614 --> 26:42.560
Can I choose myself for once?

300
26:43.179 --> 26:45.440
If I don't, I know I'll regret it forever.

301
26:47.083 --> 26:49.200
I just wanna go out and live my own life.

302
26:50.236 --> 26:52.100
I wanna make my own choices for once.

303
26:53.846 --> 26:55.000
And if I fail...

304
26:56.352 --> 26:58.272
can't it at least be because of a choice I made?

305
27:06.803 --> 27:08.936
Hey, are you getting on or not?

306
27:09.700 --> 27:10.880
We're about to leave.

307
27:13.144 --> 27:14.260
I'm coming.

308
27:14.400 --> 27:15.401
Blue.

309
27:16.765 --> 27:18.250
Hurry up. We're gonna miss the bus.

310
27:19.410 --> 27:22.050
No matter what I say, you're not gonna break up with her, are you?

311
27:29.022 --> 27:31.000
If you're really set on leaving,

312
27:36.630 --> 27:38.160
I'll let you take the exam in Bangkok.

313
27:40.206 --> 27:42.480
And if you get in on your own,

314
27:44.376 --> 27:45.720
I'll support you

315
27:46.771 --> 27:47.960
and let you study there.

316
27:49.507 --> 27:50.508
You mean it?

317
27:50.638 --> 27:51.639
Yeah.

318
27:53.240 --> 27:55.900
But I'll never approve of you being with that girl.

319
27:58.011 --> 28:01.080
When Mom died, Dad told me

320
28:03.019 --> 28:05.512
we don't get to choose who we fall in love with.

321
28:07.614 --> 28:08.615
But we do get to choose

322
28:10.462 --> 28:12.902
what we're willing to give up for what we want to hold on to.

323
28:14.931 --> 28:16.480
I didn't get it back then.

324
28:18.958 --> 28:19.959
Now I do.

325
28:30.651 --> 28:32.763
And stop thinking I'm so mean.

326
28:33.920 --> 28:36.000
I love you more than anyone in this family, dumbass.

327
28:50.599 --> 28:52.552
[Applicant Details for Srisilapasat University]

328
28:52.798 --> 28:55.640
What's this? Aren't we going to the same university?

329
28:56.622 --> 28:57.623
We are.

330
28:58.307 --> 28:59.308
Look.

331
28:59.608 --> 29:02.000
I applied to Srisilapasat too—the one you wanna go to.

332
29:02.910 --> 29:04.500
When did you apply?

333
29:07.062 --> 29:09.600
I don't want you giving up on your dream for me.

334
29:10.459 --> 29:11.899
I'll work hard and get in on my own.

335
29:12.582 --> 29:14.854
And I'll figure out what I wanna do with my life too.

336
29:17.000 --> 29:18.001
We'll go together.

337
29:48.107 --> 29:49.712
Hey, you hungry?

338
29:51.108 --> 29:52.109
A little.

339
29:52.774 --> 29:53.775
I knew it.

340
30:02.000 --> 30:04.050
You know me too well.

341
30:20.600 --> 30:21.800
This is so good.

342
30:31.646 --> 30:33.064
Wanna pray for some luck first?

343
30:34.000 --> 30:36.401
Wait, aren't you Christian?

344
30:37.230 --> 30:40.900
Yeah, but it can't hurt.

345
30:41.680 --> 30:42.681
You never know.

346
30:43.238 --> 30:45.510
I'll take all the help I can get right now.

347
30:46.196 --> 30:48.720
I'm sure Buddha won't mind, right?

348
30:50.075 --> 30:51.996
Sure, why not?

349
31:04.507 --> 31:05.508
- Let's go. - Go.

350
31:08.723 --> 31:09.724
Let me fix your shoes.

351
31:10.062 --> 31:11.063
What?

352
31:17.582 --> 31:19.200
Let's just do our best.

353
31:21.075 --> 31:22.076
Let's go.

354
31:30.500 --> 31:32.860
[Srisilapasat University Direct Admission Exam Exam Room 1]

355
32:33.430 --> 32:34.431
How'd it go?

356
32:35.152 --> 32:36.153
I'm just glad it's over.

357
32:36.600 --> 32:39.040
I hope I get in. I really don't wanna take another exam.

358
32:39.691 --> 32:41.692
You did great. You've got this.

359
32:43.142 --> 32:44.143
Come on.

360
32:49.611 --> 32:52.400
Our bus isn't until this evening.

361
32:52.993 --> 32:55.160
Wanna grab something to eat before we head back?

362
32:56.120 --> 32:58.740
I was gonna ask you the same thing.

363
33:01.126 --> 33:03.280
Wherever you go, I'm going too.

364
33:03.900 --> 33:04.901
Let's stick together.

365
33:06.944 --> 33:08.918
- You promise? - Yeah.

366
33:09.062 --> 33:10.800
- Are you sure? - I'm sure.

367
33:11.808 --> 33:14.009
You can't leave me, okay?

368
33:17.995 --> 33:18.996
Okay, I promise.

369
33:22.272 --> 33:23.600
Hey!

370
33:24.191 --> 33:25.192
I promise.

371
35:23.544 --> 35:25.720
I wish we could stay here forever.

372
35:27.400 --> 35:30.120
Soon, we really will.

373
35:30.701 --> 35:31.702
We'll be here together.

374
35:37.216 --> 35:39.800
♪ A gentle breeze blows by ♪

375
35:39.920 --> 35:42.360
♪ And tears begin to fall ♪

376
35:42.523 --> 35:44.960
♪ Only the scent of love remains ♪

377
35:45.205 --> 35:47.680
♪ Lingering in my loneliness ♪

378
35:47.803 --> 35:52.880
♪ Our love has yet to fade, still etched upon my heart ♪

379
35:53.152 --> 35:56.320
♪ Its sweet fragrance still haunts my dreams ♪

380
35:56.629 --> 36:01.040
♪ All that remains is a scent that never fades ♪

381
36:01.960 --> 36:06.440
♪ Still as sweet as it was when the breeze blows by ♪

382
36:07.280 --> 36:11.481
♪ Leaving only memories that can never return ♪

383
36:13.300 --> 36:15.101
Every time I'm with you, Blue,

384
36:15.501 --> 36:16.798
my heart never stops racing.

385
36:17.032 --> 36:19.320
I never want

386
36:21.320 --> 36:23.400
any of our days together

387
36:23.508 --> 36:24.640
to end.

388
36:24.732 --> 36:26.800
♪ Your sweetness is too much to resist ♪

389
36:27.016 --> 36:29.520
♪ My heart flutters every time ♪

390
36:31.668 --> 36:34.569
I don't know

391
36:35.310 --> 36:36.990
if this is what liking someone feels like.

392
36:37.960 --> 36:39.400
But I think I like you, Blue.

393
36:39.460 --> 36:43.200
♪ All that remains is a scent that never fades ♪

394
36:44.161 --> 36:48.680
♪ Still as sweet as it was when the breeze blows by ♪

395
36:49.480 --> 36:53.760
♪ Leaving only memories that can never return ♪

396
36:54.651 --> 36:57.252
♪ I keep you hidden in my heart ♪

397
37:10.680 --> 37:14.680
♪ Leaving only a past that can never return ♪

398
37:15.840 --> 37:18.341
♪ I keep you hidden in my heart ♪

399
37:33.179 --> 37:34.400
Ever done it before?

400
37:45.700 --> 37:46.701
No, but I want to.

401
39:34.331 --> 39:35.332
Are we gonna make it?

402
39:35.819 --> 39:36.880
There! Over there!

403
39:38.656 --> 39:39.657
Hey!

404
39:43.294 --> 39:44.800
Oh, shit. We're really screwed now.

405
39:46.046 --> 39:47.806
- Hey! - Hey!

406
39:48.739 --> 39:51.300
Sorry, we're closed. No more buses tonight.

407
39:52.331 --> 39:53.332
What do we do?

408
39:53.440 --> 39:56.841
But if you hurry, there's one last van out back.

409
39:57.360 --> 39:59.250
- That one? - Yeah, just go.

410
39:59.771 --> 40:01.440
- Hurry up. - Thank you.

411
40:15.974 --> 40:17.700
How'd it go, Dad? Everything work out?

412
40:19.300 --> 40:20.816
Couldn't have gone better.

413
40:21.622 --> 40:23.182
Not only did I get the money we needed,

414
40:23.374 --> 40:25.320
they're gonna invest with us too.

415
40:25.656 --> 40:27.200
We're celebrating tonight!

416
40:28.360 --> 40:29.361
Big!

417
40:30.261 --> 40:32.720
Order a big pot of sukiyaki for everyone.

418
40:33.762 --> 40:34.763
Sure, Dad.

419
40:45.763 --> 40:46.764
Where's Tokyo?

420
40:55.896 --> 40:57.000
No idea, Dad.

421
40:57.683 --> 40:59.076
I haven't seen her since this morning.

422
40:59.100 --> 41:00.640
I saw Miss Tokyo this morning, sir.

423
41:03.000 --> 41:04.001
What the hell?

424
41:04.904 --> 41:06.464
If you've got something to say, say it.

425
41:06.819 --> 41:07.960
Cat got your tongue?

426
41:09.820 --> 41:12.280
Or do I have to make you talk at gunpoint?

427
41:13.240 --> 41:16.480
I saw Tokyo leave the house in her school uniform before dawn, Boss.

428
41:17.300 --> 41:18.520
That's all I know.

429
41:21.550 --> 41:24.600
Don't worry, Dad. I'll have the cops search the whole town.

430
41:27.118 --> 41:28.700
Get our guys out looking too.

431
41:29.800 --> 41:30.840
Find her.

432
41:42.323 --> 41:43.324
Go!

433
41:46.800 --> 41:47.801
Shit.

434
41:48.342 --> 41:49.443
We're so screwed.

435
41:55.558 --> 41:56.559
God...

436
41:56.760 --> 41:58.761
[Get back here now. Dad knows.]

437
41:59.708 --> 42:01.160
Call me if you hear anything.

438
42:05.368 --> 42:07.700
Pakkad said Blue still hasn't gone back to the dorm.

439
42:08.490 --> 42:09.640
And it's already this late.

440
42:26.864 --> 42:28.400
- Yi! - Mom!

441
42:32.499 --> 42:33.500
Dad!

442
42:38.256 --> 42:39.257
Blue!

443
43:13.262 --> 43:14.379
[Next Episode] From now on,

444
43:14.403 --> 43:17.120
you're not to contact anyone whatsoever.

445
43:17.352 --> 43:18.653
Forget about Tokyo.

446
43:18.718 --> 43:21.120
From now on, you're moving back home.

447
43:21.750 --> 43:24.363
I think you and your girlfriend should leave this town as soon as possible.

448
43:24.387 --> 43:27.240
I have a feeling our family and theirs will clash sooner or later.

449
43:27.588 --> 43:28.902
If we want to put an end to all this,

450
43:28.926 --> 43:30.827
we may have to work together to find out

451
43:31.240 --> 43:32.480
how it all began

452
43:33.000 --> 43:34.401
17 years ago...

453
43:35.331 --> 43:37.000
what happened to Mom?
